<title>USA: U.S. Satellite Q2 Dec 31 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>U.S. Satellite Q2 Dec 31 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	  $0.46     loss	 $0.31</p>
<p> Net	  loss	 41,075     loss	27,518</p>
<p> Revs			92,104		   40,001</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  89,811		   89,811</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 1996 loss includes $17.0 million charge from manufacturer incentive program for the sale of DSS units. The charge increased the net loss by $12.8 million or $0.15 a share. Without it, the Q2 1996 loss would be $0.31 a share.  </p>
<p>	  SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	  $0.72     loss	 $0.61</p>
<p> Net	  loss	 64,557     loss	54,677</p>
<p> Revs		     171,348		   70,721</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  89,811		   89,811</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is U.S. Satellite Broadcasting Co.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
